<head>
  <title>404 - 页面未找到</title>
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex">
</head>

<section class="sk-section sk-list-page">
  <h1 class="title_style_01">404</h1>
  <div class="sk-list-sub sk-muted">抱歉，您访问的内容不存在或已被移除。</div>
  <div class="sk-search-all">
    <a href="/">← 返回首页</a> &nbsp; <a href="/blog">浏览所有文章</a>
  </div>
  <form class="sk-404-search" action="/search" method="get" role="search">
    <input type="search" name="q" placeholder="搜索文章…" aria-label="搜索">
    <button type="submit">搜索</button>
  </form>
</section>
